## Repository Structure

No root `package.json` — each package in `packages/` manages its own `node_modules`.

```
packages/
  <app-id>/             ← Electron GUI app
  desktop-manager/      ← system tray, app launcher IPC, APP_REGISTRY + APP_BINS
  desktop-shell/        ← GNOME extensions, install.sh
  robos-icons/          ← canonical SVG icon registry (Node + browser variants)
  icon-lib/             ← duplicate icon registry (must stay in sync with robos-icons)
  robos-lib/            ← shared: category registry, .desktop file validator
  task-manager/         ← process viewer, KNOWN_APPS map
  dev-harness/          ← Electron sandbox with stub CLIs and named scenarios
  mcp-servers/          ← one MCP server per integration domain
infra/
  desktop/run.sh        ← QEMU VM launcher
  ansible/              ← post-install provisioning playbooks
```

